 ----- RESOLVED RESONANCE PARAMETERS (1.e-5 - 2250 eV) -----      9228 1451  142
  The resolved resonance parameters are the same as those in      9228 1451  143
ENDF/B-VI Release 8.  These parameters are from a new analysis    9228 1451  144
for 235U by Leal et al. (Le97), using the multilevel R-matrix     9228 1451  145
analysis code SAMMY (La96).  The energy range for resolved region 9228 1451  146
is 0 to 2.25 keV.                                                 9228 1451  147
  For the first time, integral data were fitted during the        9228 1451  148
analysis process:  Thermal cross sections (fission, capture, and  9228 1451  149
elastic), Westcott g-factors (fission and absorption) are from    9228 1451  150
the ENDF/B-6 standards (Ca93), and the K1 value is from Hardy     9228 1451  151
(Ha79).                                                           9228 1451  152
  Thermal parameters were obtained in the present evaluation,     9228 1451  153
first, using the microscopic experimental data only, and second,  9228 1451  154
including the integral data as well. (Note that Version VII       9228 1451  155
thermal standards are not incorporated.) Our results are compared 9228 1451  156
to the SAMMY input in the following table:                        9228 1451  157
