  The fission and capture resonance integral calculated from the  9228 1451  221
present evaluation are 276.04 b and 140.49 b respectively, giving 9228 1451  222
a capture-to-fission ratio (alpha value) of 0.509, in excellent   9228 1451  223
agreement with the value obtained from integral measurements.     9228 1451  224
